        {
          "settings": {
            "handlerType": "Tool",
            "resourceUri": "",
            "handlerName": "get_appointment_slots",
            "handlerDescription": "List open technician slots (from tomorrow, with spots left) for appointment_type METER_UPGRADE (analog to smart meter, free) or METER_INSPECTION, and whether that type is allowed for the verified customer (allowed yes/no with reason_code, e.g. ALREADY_SMART). Quote any reason_text to the user as written; never change an outcome.",
