              "value": "{}",
              "fe_metadata": "{}"
            },
            "outputSchema": "",
            "structuredContent": {}
          },
          "name": "confirm_action_flow",
          "description": "Step 2 of 2: execute a proposal the customer has explicitly confirmed. Pass the proposal_id from propose_action. The system re-checks every rule and returns EXECUTED with a reference (e.g. RPL-ACT-000101) and, for an outage, the ticket id, whether it is LINKED to a known outage and the estimated restoration; or BLOCKED / EXPIRED / NOT_FOUND / ALREADY_DONE with the reason. Only call after the customer says yes to the exact proposal. Quote any reason_text to the user as written; never change an outcome.",
          "schemas": {
