        {
          "settings": {
            "handlerType": "Tool",
            "resourceUri": "",
            "handlerName": "open_service_case",
            "handlerDescription": "Hand a request that needs a person to the right team. request_type is billing_dispute (estimated-read disputes, re-bills, refunds, credits - Billing Review), payment_arrangement (paying a past-due balance in installments - Credit & Collections), medical_baseline (protection for life-support or medical equipment - Customer Care) or hazardous_condition (downed, sparking or burning lines or equipment - Emergency Dispatch). summary = the customer's request in their own words; agent_brief = a neutral 1-3 sentence brief for the reviewer (e.g. the bill explanation or the triage result; facts only, no recommendation); requested_amount = the dollar amount the customer asks for, or empty. The system routes it and returns OPENED with case_id, team, sla_text and reply deadline, EXISTING, or INVALID_TYPE. The assistant never decides, promises or predicts the outcome. Quote any reason_text to the user as written; never change an outcome.",
