        {
          "settings": {
            "handlerType": "Tool",
            "resourceUri": "",
            "handlerName": "decide_review_case",
            "handlerDescription": "Record a reviewer's decision after they explicitly confirmed it. decision = APPROVE or REJECT; amount = the approved dollar amount for a bill credit or payment arrangement (empty = the requested amount or the eligible maximum; ignored for REJECT); internal_note = the reviewer's reason (at least 5 characters, never shown to the customer); customer_message = what the customer will see. The system checks role, team, status, amount and the reviewer's approval limit; on success the case is APPROVED or REJECTED and an approval executes the parked action (bill credit, payment arrangement, protection flag). Returns DECIDED with what was executed, or BLOCKED with reason_code (NOT_YOUR_TEAM, NOT_FOUND, ALREADY_DECIDED, NOTE_REQUIRED, INVALID_DECISION, AMOUNT_INVALID, OVER_AUTHORITY - the case stays open for a senior reviewer), or NOT_REVIEWER. Quote any reason_text to the user as written; never change an outcome.",
