        "name": "verify_customer_flow",
        "description": "Verify a Ridgeline Power &amp; Light customer with their account number (RPL-100101, RPL 100101 or 100101 all work) and the one-time code texted to them. Returns VERIFIED with a session_token (valid 30 minutes) and their first name, VERIFY_FAILED, or VERIFY_LOCKED after too many attempts. Call this before any other customer tool. Never reveal, guess or hint at codes. Quote any reason_text to the user as written; never change an outcome.",
